<% content_for :title, "Importa impegni" %>
<div class="mx-auto max-w-5xl px-4 py-8">
  <h1 class="text-2xl font-black text-slate-950">Importa ed esporta impegni</h1>
  <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-600">L’esportazione non cambia dati. In produzione il file resta in bozza finché il superadmin non lo conferma.</p>
  <div class="mt-6 flex flex-wrap gap-3"><%= link_to "Scarica JSON", export_admin_data_commitment_imports_path, class: "rounded-lg bg-blue-600 px-4 py-2.5 text-sm font-bold text-white" %><%= button_to "Metti in coda per il deploy", queue_export_admin_data_commitment_imports_path, class: "rounded-lg bg-emerald-600 px-4 py-2.5 text-sm font-bold text-white" %><%= link_to "Dashboard", admin_dashboard_path, class: "rounded-lg border border-slate-300 px-4 py-2.5 text-sm font-bold text-slate-700" %></div>
  <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-slate-500">La coda è locale e non entra in Git. Al deploy i file vengono inviati in produzione come richieste da approvare nel profilo interessato.</p>
  <section class="mt-6 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-5 shadow-sm"><h2 class="text-lg font-black">Carica un’esportazione</h2><%= form_with url: admin_data_commitment_imports_path, multipart: true, class: "mt-4 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3" do |form| %><%= form.file_field :file, accept: "application/json", required: true, class: "text-sm" %><%= form.submit "Crea anteprima", class: "cursor-pointer rounded-lg bg-slate-900 px-4 py-2.5 text-sm font-bold text-white" %><% end %></section>
  <section class="mt-6 overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white"><% if @imports.any? %><div class="divide-y divide-slate-100"><% @imports.each do |import| %><article class="p-5"><div class="flex flex-wrap items-start justify-between gap-3"><div><h2 class="font-bold text-slate-900"><%= import.source_name %></h2><p class="mt-1 text-sm text-slate-500"><%= import.summary["total"] %> impegni · <%= import.summary["new"] %> nuovi · <%= import.summary["updates"] %> aggiornamenti</p></div><span class="rounded-full px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-bold <%= import.status == 'pending' ? 'bg-amber-50 text-amber-700' : 'bg-emerald-50 text-emerald-700' %>"><%= import.status == 'pending' ? 'Da confermare' : 'Applicata' %></span></div><% if import.status == 'pending' %><%= button_to "Importa #{import.summary['total']} impegni", apply_admin_data_commitment_import_path(import), method: :patch, data: { turbo_confirm: "Applicare questa importazione? Gli impegni con la stessa chiave verranno aggiornati." }, class: "mt-4 rounded-lg bg-emerald-600 px-4 py-2.5 text-sm font-bold text-white" %><% else %><p class="mt-3 text-sm text-slate-500">Applicata il <%= l(import.applied_at, format: :long) %>.</p><% end %></article><% end %></div><% else %><p class="p-8 text-sm text-slate-500">Nessuna importazione caricata.</p><% end %></section>
</div>
